operator "*" is not available for u8x16: lanes of 8 bits have no multiply
operator "/" is not available for u8x16: integer lanes have no divide
operator "-" is not available for u8x16: its lanes have no sign
operator "/" is not available for i16x8: integer lanes have no divide
operator "*" is not available for i8x16: lanes of 8 bits have no multiply
operator "-" is not available for u32x4: its lanes have no sign
